      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "This itinerary balances Kyoto's rich cultural heritage with engaging activities for children, ensuring a memorable trip for the whole family. Days are organized by neighborhood to minimize travel time, allowing for a relaxed pace. November is a beautiful time to visit, with pleasant weather and the beginning of autumn foliage."
