    "planning_text": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "This plan assumes your family will utilize Kyoto's efficient public transportation system (buses and subways). A one-day bus pass (around ¥700 for adults) can be a cost-effective option for days with multiple bus trips. All attraction fees are approximate per person and subject to change."
