    },
    "day1_details": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "- **Morning:** Visit the magnificent **Kiyomizu-dera Temple**, perched on a hillside with panoramic views of the city. The walk up through the historic Higashiyama District is part of the experience. (Fee: ~¥400)\n- **Afternoon:** Explore the charming, preserved streets of **Sannenzaka and Ninenzaka**. These pedestrian-only lanes are filled with traditional shops and teahouses, perfect for finding souvenirs and snacks.\n- **Dinner:** Enjoy a casual meal in the nearby **Gion district**. Find a restaurant serving Okonomiyaki (savory pancakes) or Yakitori (grilled skewers), which are fun and interactive dining experiences for kids."
      },
      "children": []
