    },
    "day2_details": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "- **Morning:** Marvel at the stunning **Kinkaku-ji (Golden Pavilion)**. The top two floors of this Zen Buddhist temple are completely covered in gold leaf, creating a breathtaking reflection in the surrounding pond. (Fee: ~¥500)\n- **Afternoon:** Immerse yourselves in the world of Japanese cinema at **Toei Kyoto Studio Park (Eigamura)**. This active film set features ninja shows, a samurai maze, and opportunities to dress up in period costumes. (Fee: Adults ~¥2,400, Children ~¥1,200-¥1,400)\n- **Dinner:** Head to a local ramen shop for a comforting and delicious meal. The rich broth and customizable toppings make it a crowd-pleaser for all ages."
      },
